---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story & Team — FADE STUDIO | Unisex Grooming & Hair Studio"
  description="Discover FADE STUDIO"
  currentPage="about"
  showPreloader={false}
>
  <main id="mainContent">

    <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner">
        <span class="page-kicker">OUR ETHOS & ORIGIN</span>
        <h1 class="page-hero-title">
          A studio built to make <span class="italic-serif">good grooming easy.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="page-hero-desc">
          FADE STUDIO was founded on a simple realization: visiting a salon or barber shouldn't be an intimidating gamble or a rushed chore. It should be a restorative ritual led by artists who listen first.
        </p>
        <div class="page-hero-cta">
          <a href="#team" class="btn btn-charcoal">Meet the Specialists</a>
          <a href="#values" class="btn btn-outline">Our Core Values</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SECTION 1: THE STORY ==================== -->
    <section class="content-section" id="story">
      <div class="statement-container">
        <div class="statement-left">
          <span class="section-kicker">THE BACKGROUND</span>
          <h2 class="statement-heading">
            Born from respect for the <span class="italic-serif">craft.</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="statement-paragraphs">
            <p class="statement-lead">
              For too long, grooming has been split into two extremes: noisy, chaotic neighbourhood shops that rush you in fifteen minutes, or overpriced luxury salons that prioritize pretension over precision.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2024, Vikram Malhotra and Priya Sharma founded FADE STUDIO in Bengaluru to establish a thoughtful middle ground. A serene, minimalist sanctuary where men can get master-level skin fades and straight-razor shaves, and women can receive contemporary haircuts and bespoke colour treatments without attitude.
            </p>
            <p>
              We view grooming as an essential form of self-respect. When your hair is cut right and your skin is cared for, you carry yourself differently. That quiet confidence is what we build every day.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="statement-right">
          <div class="statement-photo-duo">
            <div class="statement-photo-item photo-high">
              <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/image-10.jpg" alt="Tailored hair discipline at FADE STUDIO" class="statement-img">
              <span class="photo-subtext">CRAFT · PRECISION SCISSORWORK</span>
            </div>
            <div class="statement-photo-item photo-low">
              <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/image-2.jpg" alt="Master barber founder aesthetic" class="statement-img">
              <span class="photo-subtext">IDENTITY · MODERN ELEVATION</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SECTION 2: 3 CORE VALUES (THEME DARK) ==================== -->
    <section class="content-section theme-dark" id="values">
      <div class="section-header-block">
        <span class="section-kicker">GUIDING PRINCIPLES</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">The three pillars of <span class="italic-serif">FADE STUDIO.</span></h2>
        <p class="section-desc">We measure our success not by how many chairs we turn over, but by the trust of our returning clients.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card" style="background-color: var(--color-charcoal-card); border-color: var(--color-border-dark);">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <h3 class="step-title" style="color:var(--color-ivory);">Listen First</h3>
          <p class="step-desc" style="color:#D5D2CB;">
            We never pick up the clippers until we understand what you want. We discuss cowlicks, lifestyle, maintenance preferences, and how you style your hair at home.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" style="background-color: var(--color-charcoal-card); border-color: var(--color-border-dark);">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <h3 class="step-title" style="color:var(--color-ivory);">Clean Work</h3>
          <p class="step-desc" style="color:#D5D2CB;">
            Surgical hygiene is non-negotiable. Medical-grade UV sterilization for all tools, fresh sanitized capes for every guest, single-use razor blades, and pristine stations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" style="background-color: var(--color-charcoal-card); border-color: var(--color-border-dark);">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <h3 class="step-title" style="color:var(--color-ivory);">Fair Prices</h3>
          <p class="step-desc" style="color:#D5D2CB;">
            Transparent pricing with no surprise add-ons. Haircuts include wash and finish. Beard care includes hot towel compresses. Honest rates for world-class craftsmanship.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SECTION 3: THE TEAM ==================== -->
    <section class="content-section" id="team">
      <div class="section-header-block">
        <span class="section-kicker">THE ARTISTS</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Meet the resident <span class="italic-serif">craftsmen.</span></h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Our core team combines diverse master disciplines across men's barbering, women's texture, and bridal hair design.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-groups-grid team-grid">
        <!-- Specialist 1 -->
        <div class="service-category-card">
          <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/team-1.jpg" alt="Vikram Malhotra - Master Barber" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          </div>
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--color-gold); text-transform:uppercase;">FOUNDER & MASTER BARBER</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:26px; margin: 6px 0;">Vikram Malhotra</h3>
          <p style="font-size:11.5px; font-style:italic; color:#555; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:16px;">
            12 years of experience mastering straight razor fades and skull anatomy cutting. Trained in London and Mumbai.
          </p>
          <a href="/book?stylist=Vikram+Malhotra" class="btn btn-charcoal" style="width:100%;">Book with Vikram</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Specialist 2 -->
        <div class="service-category-card">
          <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/team-2.jpg" alt="Arjun Nair - Senior Fade Specialist" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          </div>
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--color-gold); text-transform:uppercase;">SENIOR FADE & BEARD SPECIALIST</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:26px; margin: 6px 0;">Arjun Nair</h3>
          <p style="font-size:11.5px; font-style:italic; color:#555; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:16px;">
            8 years of expertise in razor-sharp skin fades, textured French crops, and bespoke beard alignment.
          </p>
          <a href="/book?stylist=Arjun+Nair" class="btn btn-charcoal" style="width:100%;">Book with Arjun</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Specialist 3 -->
        <div class="service-category-card">
          <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/team-3.jpg" alt="Priya Sharma - Creative Director" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          </div>
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--color-gold); text-transform:uppercase;">CREATIVE DIRECTOR - WOMEN'S HAIR</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:26px; margin: 6px 0;">Priya Sharma</h3>
          <p style="font-size:11.5px; font-style:italic; color:#555; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:16px;">
            10 years directing editorial shoots, balayage, and couture bridal hair. Passionate about hair health and clean lines.
          </p>
          <a href="/book?stylist=Priya+Sharma" class="btn btn-charcoal" style="width:100%;">Book with Priya</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Specialist 4 -->
        <div class="service-category-card">
          <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/team-4.jpg" alt="Kabir Mehta - Stylist & Texture Specialist" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          </div>
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--color-gold); text-transform:uppercase;">STYLIST & TEXTURE SPECIALIST</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:26px; margin: 6px 0;">Kabir Mehta</h3>
          <p style="font-size:11.5px; font-style:italic; color:#555; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:16px;">
            6 years specializing in hair spas, curl care, anti-dandruff scalp therapies, and natural blow-dry finishes.
          </p>
          <a href="/book?stylist=Kabir+Mehta" class="btn btn-charcoal" style="width:100%;">Book with Kabir</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== CALL TO ACTION STRIP ==================== -->
    <section class="booking-cta-strip">
      <div class="booking-cta-inner">
        <div class="cta-left">
          <span class="cta-kicker">PERSONALIZED CHAIR TIME</span>
          <h2 class="cta-heading">Experience the difference in <span class="italic-serif">our chair.</span></h2>
          <p class="cta-desc">Choose your preferred specialist or allow our concierge to match you with the ideal stylist for your hair type.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="/book" class="btn btn-gold">Book Your Appointment</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
